    "sl_custom_faq_r7Q6ht": {
      "type": "sl-custom-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_qjMHfp": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How is this different from getting regular acne facials?",
            "answer": "<p>A single acne facial addresses what's on your skin today — but acne that's already forming underneath won't be visible for another 60-90 days. Acne Bootcamp is a complete system: education to understand your acne, consistent treatments to stay ahead of the cycle, customized homecare, lifestyle factor analysis, and ongoing support. It's the difference between putting out fires and preventing them from starting.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_PzXEKn": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does Acne Bootcamp take to see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Because acne takes 60-90 days to form, you need to give your new routine at least that long to see significant changes. Many clients notice improvements by month 2-3, with the most dramatic results typically visible by month 4-6. The full program is designed as a 9-month journey, with more frequent check-ins early on that taper as your skin stabilizes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_GmWhMf": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will my skin get worse before it gets better?",
            "answer": "<p>It's possible, especially in the first 3-4 months. Remember, we're bringing to the surface acne that was already forming deep in your pores. This can be emotionally tough, which is exactly why we offer ongoing text support. We'll be there to reassure you, adjust your routine if needed, and remind you that this phase is temporary and part of the clearing process.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_PGh67J": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's included in the homecare investment?",
            "answer": "<p>Expect to invest approximately $250-300 in professional-grade, acne-safe skincare products at the start of your program. These are carefully selected for YOUR skin and will last 2-3 months. We'll never recommend products you don't need — only what will actually help you clear. Many clients find they spend LESS than they were on random products that weren't working.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_XkqtLR": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is Acne Bootcamp only for face acne?",
            "answer": "<p>No! We treat face, chest, and back acne. The same principles apply — understanding the acne cycle, using proper products, and eliminating triggers. During your assessment, we'll discuss all the areas you want to address and create a comprehensive plan.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_P6KPXe": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can acne actually be \"cured\"?",
            "answer": "<p>We believe in being honest: acne is managed, not cured. If you're genetically prone to acne, that won't change. BUT — with the right routine, products, and lifestyle adjustments, you can dramatically reduce breakouts and maintain clear skin long-term. Our goal is to get you clear AND teach you how to stay clear, so you're not dependent on us forever.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_qG8nq8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does Virtual Acne Bootcamp work?",
            "answer": "<p>Virtual clients receive all the same education, personalized planning, and ongoing support — just via video calls instead of in-person. You'll have a 30-minute initial consultation, followed by regular check-ins (bi-weekly for the first 3 months, then monthly). You'll send photos before each check-in, and you have text access to us throughout your journey. The main difference is you won't receive in-spa extractions, but we'll guide your at-home routine to achieve the same results.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "faq_item_qjMHfp",
        "faq_item_PzXEKn",
